<title>USA: Group ups Ergo Science stake to 13.42 pct.</title>
<headline>Group ups Ergo Science stake to 13.42 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Amerindo Investment Advisors Inc said Friday that it increased its stake in Ergo Science Corp to 1,365,000 common shares, or 13.42 percent of the total outstanding, from 1,025,000 shares, or 9.9 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 340,000 common shares on September 19 at $11.00 a share.</p>
<p>In midafternoon trade Friday, Ergo was up 1-1/4 at 12-1/4.</p>
</text>
